id=voiceguard_privileged_capture
name=VoiceGuard Privileged Call Capture
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=VoiceGuard
description=Installs the VoiceGuard "privileged" build flavor as a system priv-app and grants it CAPTURE_AUDIO_OUTPUT, so its existing AudioCaptureManager VOICE_CALL cascade can capture real cellular downlink audio instead of falling back to acoustic (mic+speakerphone) capture. See README.md in this directory before installing.
